        <div class="fc-delta-reason">No material movement. No new independently verified evidence of a Mojtaba Khamenei public in-person appearance emerged in the Aug 27–29 window. The Aug 10 state-media releases — a purported photograph and a sub-15-second undated Mehr News video — remain the most recent public-facing material, unverified by any TIER1 outlet. Misbar's Aug 23 fact-check explicitly labeled widely circulated Khamenei videos as 2022-era footage. President Pezeshkian's claim of a ~7-hour private meeting on Aug 10 is not a public in-person appearance per resolution criteria and comes from an Iranian government source, which the criteria explicitly excludes as sufficient independent verification.</div>
